From 99fba472900695909b52792f76cce56ecf0c0ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1Pro-L4R8 <hoangquocvietbk2.13@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:54:10 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Require a privilege on the catalog for SHOW CREATE
 CATALOG

SHOW CREATE CATALOG had no privilege check: any user who could log in read
every external catalog's properties (endpoints, warehouse, and the first and
last characters of its credentials), although SHOW CATALOGS lists only the
catalogs the user has a privilege on. It now needs any privilege on the
catalog, the same rule.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
